[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0072","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0087","title":"Netscape Communicator 邮件通知 IMAP SSL 绕过漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 的 Mail Notification (nsnotify) 工具在处理 IMAP 邮件连接时存在安全绕过漏洞。即使管理员已在浏览器设置中指定使用 SSL 加密连接，该工具仍会以明文方式建立 IMAP 会话，导致用户在登录邮箱时的用户名和密码在网络传输过程中被未加密暴露。攻击者通过在网络链路中进行嗅探即可截获这些凭据信息，从而获取受害者的邮件访问权限。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 系列浏览器及邮件客户端。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0087"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.72 以上版本，该版本修复了 nsnotify 忽略 SSL 首选项的问题。如无法升级，可在客户端与 IMAP 服务器之间部署 Stunnel 建立 TLS 加密隧道，强制所有 IMAP 流量加密传输。同时建议迁移至持续维护的邮件客户端（如 Thunderbird），避免使用已停止支持的软件收发敏感邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94790377622943&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4385.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0087.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0087","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0087.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0087.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2pg3-3pf8-92c8/GHSA-2pg3-3pf8-92c8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0087.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88212/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/aad0c565cec09d12eb0b48174d0da4caa60411fd/sara/PLIST"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0057","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0070","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 LPC 端口请求欺骗权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 NtImpersonateClientOfPort 本地过程调用（LPC）存在权限提升漏洞，漏洞源于 LPC 端口请求伪造（Spoofed LPC Port Request）。本地攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 LPC 端口请求，利用该漏洞冒充客户端在服务端进程中执行操作，从而获得系统级权限。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。微软已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0070"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-003 提供的补丁程序。Windows NT 4.0 Workstation/Server/Enterprise Edition 用户请从 Microsoft Download Center 下载并安装对应补丁（Intel 版或 Alpha 版）；Windows NT 4.0 Server Terminal Server Edition 用户请升级至 Service Pack 6。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制用户交互式登录权限，仅允许受信任用户从键盘登录服务器以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ247869","http://www.bindview.com/security/advisory/adv_NtImpersonate.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/934","http://xforce.iss.net/search.php3?type=2&pattern=nt-spoofed-lpc-port","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-003","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0070","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0070.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0070.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7c6r-7p46-359r/GHSA-7c6r-7p46-359r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--99611cb0-8d9a-4f96-8642-43afab66e0c0.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0070.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001098.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0040","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0048","title":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 get_it 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 的 get_it 程序存在 PATH 环境变量操纵漏洞，本地低权限用户可通过设置恶意的 PATH 环境变量，使 get_it 调用攻击者控制的恶意 cp 程序替代系统 cp，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0048"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53Z","remediation":"升级到 Corel Linux 的官方补丁版本，或修改 get_it 脚本中将 cp 等命令改为绝对路径（如 /bin/cp）；同时移除 get_it 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/get_it），限制非信任用户执行。鉴于 Corel Linux 已停止维护，建议迁移至持续更新的发行版（如 Ubuntu/Debian）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://linux.corel.com/support/clos_patch1.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/928","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0048.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0048","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0048.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0048.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/412d717d6f053499cbceb993220b04e36c6778d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vp5h-j8h3-xvg2/GHSA-vp5h-j8h3-xvg2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0048.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--e16005b9-5841-4a01-90d1-9a5fa7ea2e65.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0040.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0040.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0208","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0074","title":"PowerScripts PlusMail WebConsole 弱认证漏洞","description":"PowerScripts PlusMail WebConsole 1.0 的 CGI 程序存在权限认证缺陷，密码文件权限设置不当，导致远程攻击者无需有效凭据即可通过直接访问或修改密码文件来执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 PlusMail WebConsole 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者利用此漏洞可完全控制目标邮件服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0074"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56Z","remediation":"立即将 PlusMail 密码文件权限修改为 600（仅所有者可读写），禁止密码文件存放于 Web 可访问目录下。通过 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置对该 CGI 脚本实施 IP 白名单访问控制和额外 HTTP 基本认证。由于 PowerScripts 产品已停止维护且不再发布安全更新，建议迁移至仍保持维护的邮件管理平台以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0074","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20801","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0074.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0074","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/919d6cac5eadae13826d4a35bab84cf2bac57965/2000/CVE-2000-0074.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0074.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3p8m-qpqj-m94w/GHSA-3p8m-qpqj-m94w.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0074.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/plusmail.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0058","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0071","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 物理路径泄露漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送针对不存在的 .ida 或 .idq 扩展名文件的 HTTP 请求，获取 Web 文档根目录的真实物理路径。该漏洞可帮助攻击者进一步探测目标服务器系统结构及文件布局，为后续渗透攻击提供信息支撑。此漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0071"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56Z","remediation":"立即将 IIS 4.0 升级至 IIS 6.0 或更高版本（IIS 4.0 已停止支持多年，无法通过补丁修复）。同时移除 IIS 中 .ida/.idq 的应用程序映射（网站属性 → 主目录 → 配置 → 删除 .ida/.idq 映射），并将 IIS 错误模式改为「自定义错误页」以隐藏真实路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94770020309953&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94780058006791&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0071","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0071.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0071.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-48f3-v7r7-48gh/GHSA-48f3-v7r7-48gh.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0071.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/iis_anything_idq.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0071.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0038","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0045","title":"MySQL GRANT 全局密码修改漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.22.27/3.22.29/3.23.8 版本存在权限管理缺陷，拥有 GRANT 权限的本地用户可利用 GRANT 语句修改任意 MySQL 用户的密码。攻击者只需具备本地数据库访问权限和 GRANT 授权即可触发该漏洞，无需额外认证。成功利用后可导致权限提升，获取其他用户的数据库访问控制权，影响数据库的完整性和机密性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0045"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 到 3.23.9 及以上版本，此漏洞已在后续版本中修复；限制 GRANT 权限仅授予受信任的管理员用户，避免将 GRANT 权限赋予普通用户；对于仍运行旧版本的系统，建议迁移至受支持的 MySQL 5.7 或 8.0 最新版本，并遵循最小权限原则分配用户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/926","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19721","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0045.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0045","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0045.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0045.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/68f861ef7056d26a199514826964f9781eeba15e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2j9w-mc69-3577/GHSA-2j9w-mc69-3577.json","https://github.com/marcellod