t/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0046","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0046.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0046.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icq_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icq_installed.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0046.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--69e67c4e-76b5-4fa4-90c5-5a1691ae56f8.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001093.txt","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0067","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0080","title":"IBM AIX techlibss 符号链接漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 系统的 techlibss 组件存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上创建恶意的符号链接文件，诱使 techlibss 以高权限访问并覆盖任意文件，从而实现权限提升或破坏系统关键文件。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，影响 AIX 多个版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0080"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57Z","remediation":"升级 AIX 系统上的 techlib.service.rte 文件集至 1.0.0.4 或更高版本（2000 年 1 月服务 CD 中提供）。该文件集不会随自动更新安装，需手动使用 `installp -aX -d /dev/cd0 techlib.service.rte` 命令强制升级。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 techlibss 的 SUID 位以缓解风险：`chmod -s /usr/lpp/techlib/techlibss`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94757136413681&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/931","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0080","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0080.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0080.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c9j2-8536-x27c/GHSA-c9j2-8536-x27c.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0080.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a60e0b1a-1795-470b-808a-770d843d8ba2.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0846","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0846.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1221","title":"RedHat Linux lpd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Linux 发行版（如 RedHat 6.1）及 IRIX 6.5.18 中 lpr 软件包的行式打印机守护进程（lpd）存在认证绕过漏洞。lpd 在验证客户端权限时，将本地主机反向解析的主机名与 gethostname 返回的打印服务器主机名进行比对，攻击者可通过篡改攻击 IP 的 DNS 记录，使反向解析结果与目标打印服务器主机名一致，从而绕过访问控制，以 root 权限远程执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1221"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"Red Hat Linux 系统应立即通过 Red Hat Network 或本地镜像升级 lpr 软件包至 RHSA-2000-002 勘误表修复版本，或直接升级到 Red Hat 6.2 及更高版本。IRIX 6.5.x 系统应安装 SGI 安全补丁 20021104-01-P。如暂时无法打补丁，可在防火墙中禁用 TCP 515 端口的对外访问，或通过 /etc/hosts.lpd 和 /etc/hosts.equiv 文件严格限制允许打印的主机，必要时临时停止 lpd 服务以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2000-002.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/lpd_advisory.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000109","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/30308","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/lpd_advisory","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/927","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3840","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19722","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1221.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1221","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1221.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1221.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2000/CVE-2000-1221.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1221.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0846.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0845","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0845.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1220","title":"BSD/Linux lpr 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>BSD及Linux系统中的行式打印机守护进程(lpd)存在权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于lpd在调用sendmail发送打印作业通知时，未对命令行参数进行有效验证。本地低权限用户可通过构造特殊参数（例如使用-C选项指定恶意配置文件）使sendmail以root权限执行任意命令。此漏洞影响多个Linux和BSD发行版，攻击者只需具备本地登录权限即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制系统root账户，造成严重的安全风险。CVSS评分为10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1220"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 lpr 包至已修复版本：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2000-002 提供的更新包；Debian 用户升级至 lpr 0.48 或更高版本；SGI 用户应用 20021104-01-P 补丁。如无法升级，可移除 lpd setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpr）并限制本地用户对 sendmail 的调用，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/lists/bugtraq/2000/Jan/0116.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/lpd_advisory.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000109","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/39001","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/lpd_advisory","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-002.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/927","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/325","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-1583.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1220.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1220","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1220.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0845.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0198","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0061","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 安全区域设置延迟漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 存在安全区域设置延迟漏洞。当浏览器加载文档时，系统在文档完全加载完成前未能正确应用安全区域限制，导致远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，在文档加载过程中以不同的安全上下文执行 JavaScript 脚本，从而绕过 IE 的安全区域隔离机制。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0、4.0.1、5.0、5.0.1 及 5.5 Preview 版本，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，可导致信息泄露、权限提升等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0061"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55Z","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 及以上版本（IE 6.0 于 2001 年发布，已修复该时间窗口问题）。鉴于当前 IE 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或基于 Chromium 的现代浏览器，同时在环境中禁用 IE 兼容模式及 ActiveX 以彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0061","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0061.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0061.json","https://github.com/biggerwing/nsfocus-rsas-knowledge-base/blob/156208b301d4649ead13cd15f827830d08245b89/example","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2w55-jm9h-8pcw/GHSA-2w55-jm9h-8pcw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0061.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0106","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0044","title":"War FTP 远程代码执行与任意文件读取漏洞","description":"War FTP daemon (warftpd) 1.70 及 1.67b2 版本的宏功能存在安全缺陷，本地或远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务发送特制的宏命令，绕过权限限制读取任意文件或执行系统命令。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前厂商已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 FTP 服务器软件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0044"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 War FTP Daemon 至 1.72 或更高版本，该版本已修复宏功能中的输入验证缺陷。若无法升级，在服务端配置文件中禁用宏解析功能（MacrosEnabled=false），并在防火墙中限制对 21 端口的访问为仅受信任 IP 段。同时避免将 FTP 服务暴露在公网。作为进一步缓解措施，建议迁移至更活跃维护的 FTP 服务端软件如 vsftpd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/919","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0044","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0044.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0044.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3346902a1d1e44903f43a6ca4d63e2601447c63c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qhw5-79xh-589g/GHSA-qhw5-79xh-589g.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0044.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0070","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0084","title":"CuteFTP 密码信息弱加密存储漏洞","description":"CuteFTP 使用弱加密算法将 FTP 服务器登录密码存储在本地 `tree.dat` 文件中，攻击者在获取目标系统本地文件访问权限后，可读取 `tree.dat` 文件并利用弱加密的可逆性还原明文密码，从而窃取用户的 FTP 登录凭据。该漏洞影响 CuteFTP 全系版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞。用户应升级至官方最新版本或避免在共享/多用户环境下使用该软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0084"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 CuteFTP 至 4.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复弱加密存储密码问题。如无法升级，建议停止使用 tree.dat 存储密码，改用其他安全 FTP 客户端（如 FileZilla）替代，并清除已保存的密码记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0084","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56